Text used and changes made
-------------------------

- lib/agent-texts.js: the English Guardian system prompt
  (SYSTEM_PROMPT_EN) is adapted and condensed from
  codex-rs/core/assets/guardian/policy_template.md. The opening three
  sentences and several instructions retain the upstream wording,
  apart from line wrapping. Other passages are condensed, rewritten,
  or added for this project. The transcript-source labels and
  four-tool restrictions are project modifications or additions.
  Fixed source:
  https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/03f014564deef528c25e80fe67ec51871cb6ee51/codex-rs/core/assets/guardian/policy_template.md

- REJECTION_INSTRUCTIONS_EN in lib/agent-texts.js is copied verbatim
  from the REJECTION_INSTRUCTIONS constant in
  codex-rs/ext/guardian-reviewer/src/completion.rs, lines 19-25.
  docs/requirements.md, section 4.3, quotes the same English text.
  Fixed source:
  https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/03f014564deef528c25e80fe67ec51871cb6ee51/codex-rs/ext/guardian-reviewer/src/completion.rs#L19-L25

- OUTPUT_CONTRACT in lib/agent-texts.js uses the text of
  guardian_output_contract_prompt() in
  codex-rs/ext/guardian-reviewer/src/assessment.rs, lines 107-119.
  The only change is a line break in place of the space between
  the first two sentences. Fixed source:
  https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/03f014564deef528c25e80fe67ec51871cb6ee51/codex-rs/ext/guardian-reviewer/src/assessment.rs#L107-L119

- The untrusted evidence notice in lib/agent-texts.js was written
  for this project, following the same evidence-grading approach.
  The Chinese system prompt and rejection instructions translate
  or summarize the corresponding Codex-derived English text,
  including this project's changes. The shared output contract
  remains in English.

- assets/tenant-policy.md adapts and condenses the five risk-category
  subsections under "Risk Taxonomy and Allow/Deny Rules" in
  codex-rs/core/assets/guardian/policy.md. Some outcome sentences
  retain the upstream wording after removal of the "Outcome rule:"
  prefix and capitalization changes. Other passages are near-verbatim
  or rewritten. The last two sections, "URL Opening via System Entries"
  and "Resubmission Guidance", are project additions not present in
  that source. assets/tenant-policy.zh.md translates the complete
  resulting English policy, including those additions. Fixed source:
  https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/03f014564deef528c25e80fe67ec51871cb6ee51/codex-rs/core/assets/guardian/policy.md

